  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Exclusion grounds",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Clarification and due diligence",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation requires contracting authorities to exclude suppliers from participation in a procurement procedure if they have been convicted of certain specified offences.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In exceptional circumstances, a contracting authority may disregard the mandatory exclusion grounds for overriding reasons relating to the public interest, such as public health or environmental protection.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities also have the discretion to exclude suppliers in other specified circumstances.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If a supplier is found to meet one or more of the exclusion grounds during a procurement procedure, then, depending on whether the exclusion ground is mandatory or discretionary, the supplier must or may be excluded. The duration of exclusion varies depending on the specific circumstances, with a maximum of five years for the mandatory grounds and three years for the discretionary grounds.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Additionally, there are provisions on self-cleaning which allow a supplier to provide evidence of the measures it has taken to demonstrate its reliability, despite the existence of grounds for exclusion. If the contracting authority deems this evidence sufficient, the supplier must not be excluded from the procurement. If the measures are considered to be insufficient, the contracting authority must provide reasons for its decision to exclude the supplier concerned.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If a supplier is found to meet one or more of the exclusion grounds during a procurement procedure, i.e. after conclusion of the selection stage, then, depending on whether the exclusion ground is mandatory or discretionary, the supplier must or may be excluded from the process (subject to relevant self-cleaning measures).",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "apply the grounds for exclusion throughout the procurement process",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider evidence of measures taken by suppliers to demonstrate their reliability despite the presence of one or more grounds for exclusion",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "where the self-cleaning measures provided by a supplier are considered insufficient to demonstrate the supplier’s reliability, give reasons for that decision.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Exclusion grounds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
